window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Pine Valley is a school that's both rich in history and legacy, and it's once more opening its doors to another year of students.</b></p> <p>Skylar Warren owns the streets of Pine Valley and everybody in it. From cars to people, there is nothing he wants that he can't get—until now.</p> <p>When he is offered a chance to race for the prestigious StarFire racing, Skylar realizes there are two things he wants more than anything else in this world—the championship title and Silas Townsend—and he plans to get both, whatever it takes.</p> <p>Silas \"Bones\" Townsend has the perfect life—or so everyone thinks. What they don't know is just how utterly lonely and cold his existence has become… until Skylar. The man who can enrage him like no other and won't take no for an answer. Bones finds himself dragged into Skylar's life and the spotlight, whether he wants it or not.</p> <p>This town has a way of bringing people together, however, and not even fate can stand in the way of true love.</p> <p>Buckle up, angel, because it's going to be one hell of a ride.</p> <p>Can Skylar and Bones withstand what Pine Valley has in store for them, or will crashing hearts be all that's left?</p> <p>Crashing Hearts <i>features mature content.</i></p>"; 
